# Layer A density v5 fixture (Q-060 M-4 slice a): List-returning
# String builtins by bare name. `String.Split` and `String.Join` are
# table-covered; their List<String> shapes are var-free, so the
# instantiation synthesizes one shared canonical string-list tower
# (the instantiation cache reuses it across both call sites).
@v=1 root=joined
input STR "a,b,c"
comma STR ","
dash STR "-"
parts APP String.Split [input comma]
joined APP String.Join [parts dash]
